* Small-signal model of the opened loop with the compensation branch Rz + CC from the gate (A) to the drain (B) of M1 (node M between Rz and CC)
Vt t 0 AC 1
G3 A 0 t 0 {gm3}
RO3 A 0 {r_O3}
CGS1 A 0 {C_GS1}
CGD3 A t {C_GD3}
CGD1 A B {C_GD1}
RZ A M {R_z}
CC M B {C_C}
G1 B 0 A 0 {gm1}
RO1 B 0 {r_O1}
CGS2 B 0 {C_GS2}
CGD2 B Y {C_GD2}
G2 Y 0 B 0 {gm2}
RO2 Y 0 {r_O2}
CREP Y 0 {C_GS3+C_GD3}
.end
